@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontColor #1e293b
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam arrowColor #3b82f6
skinparam arrowThickness 2

title SMC 世界切换完整流程

participant "Android App\n(EL0)" as App #e2e8f0
participant "Linux Kernel\nTEE Driver (EL1)" as Kernel #cbd5e1
participant "Secure Monitor\nATF (EL3)" as Monitor #fecaca
participant "TEE OS Kernel\n(S-EL1)" as TEEOS #86efac
participant "Trusted App\n(S-EL0)" as TA #bbf7d0

App -> Kernel : ioctl(/dev/tee0, cmd, params)
note right
  params 包含:
  - commandID
  - paramTypes (4×4bits)
  - params[4] (memref/value)
  - shared memory 物理地址
end note

Kernel -> Kernel : 分配 shared memory\n复制 params 到共享页

Kernel -> Monitor : **SMC #0**\nX0=Function ID\nX1=session handle\nX2=shared mem phys addr
note right #fecaca
  CPU 陷入 EL3
  **所有 EL1 寄存器被保存**
  SCR_EL3.NS = 1 → 0
end note

Monitor -> Monitor : 保存 Normal World 上下文\n(X0-X30, SP_EL1, ELR_EL1, SPSR_EL1)

Monitor -> Monitor : 恢复 Secure World 上下文\n设置 SCR_EL3.NS = 0

Monitor -> TEEOS : **ERET** 到 S-EL1\n(恢复的 PC = TEE OS 入口)

TEEOS -> TEEOS : 解析 shared memory\n定位目标 TA

TEEOS -> TA : 调用 TA_InvokeCommandEntryPoint\n(commandID, paramTypes, params[4])
note right #bbf7d0
  **攻击者可控输入:**
  - commandID
  - paramTypes
  - params[].memref.buffer
  - params[].memref.size
  - params[].value.a / .b
  - shared memory 内容
end note

TA -> TA : 处理命令\n← **漏洞触发点**

TA --> TEEOS : 返回 TEE_SUCCESS / TEE_ERROR
TEEOS --> Monitor : **SMC** 返回
Monitor --> Monitor : 保存 Secure World 上下文\n恢复 Normal World 上下文\n设置 SCR_EL3.NS = 1
Monitor --> Kernel : **ERET** 到 EL1
Kernel --> App : ioctl 返回

@enduml
